# The raw `strace` output and the server's own log, which are hundreds of
# kilobytes per run and are regenerated by `../syscall-survey.sh`. What is
# checked in is the distilled result — the syscall sets and their provenance —
# because that is what `crates/kmsrs-server/src/sandbox.rs` was written from
# and what `tests/sandbox.rs` reads back (`SEC-018`, #355).
strace.log
server.log
